      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Add IFF tags to nameplates!  Haha.\nIn all seriousness, the nameplates do indeed need more work.  There were mods that improved visibility, but they were not ideal either.  Though personally i hate the yellow (it's also not as visually different from white as it could be), i'd rather friends be pink or something.\nHaving the nameplates lighten up (darken background/opaquify) or sort forward and/or increase in size if you laser over their capsule might be helpful as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-08T01:07:15.407Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "One thing that's kept me off is the readability of nameplates and differentiation between Friend and Foe. To fix this, I'd suggest adding the ability to relocate how it shows someone is a friend. Potentially to a yellow border around the nameplate, which solves a colour/sight issue and makes them moderately more visible/standout.\nAlso, I think that having a border in general will help in cases where many nameplates can overlap, allowing you to see if there's a friend in a cluster of people. \nThese should be considered as viable additions to the nameplate system and would improve usability in some use-cases.",
